{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝からチップのお散歩に\nお父さんとお母さんと行ってきたよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのお散歩で\n楽しかったよ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、パン屋さんにも行って\n初めて行く場所だったから\nたくさん買っちゃった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったよ～！やっぱり甘いのが好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"より目がすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は握手会のこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東では初めての5部制！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部制になってやっと来れたよ！と言ってくださり来てくださったファンの方もたくさんいらして、\nやっぱりみなさんと顔をあわせる機会が増えることは素敵なことで幸せなことなんだ\nって改めて気づきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15枚目からは\n全会場5部制になります！\n不安です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、それ以上に楽しみたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部は 別れ際、もっと好きになる\n白バージョンを着ました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型はストレート！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、写真撮り忘れちゃった。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部は太陽ノック\nMVバージョン！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は、ウェーブに編み込み！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも撮るの忘れちゃった。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部は、不等号！\n自分の衣装！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型はおんぷちゃん外はね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこの日、\nアイメイクがノーメイクでした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな気づかなかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真だとわかるよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部は、不等号。\n袖ありの方！！！\n2パターンあるから！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型は編み込み三つ編み！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番最初に載せた写真の衣装です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"耳大きいんだ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部は嫉妬の権利！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水色バージョン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世に借りたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型はハーフアップ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/26/5137037/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怒ってるわけじゃないです。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/i